{"parentUuid":"a2e4cfa1-5a40-49e8-98bf-9efa2c197e07","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"558dcf7b-f14b-4ea9-9f9d-665cbb931712","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand the structure of the Excel files. Let me use Python to read them. Let me also read the PDF invoices to extract information from them. This is a complex multi-step task, so let me follow the CM.md instructions step by step.\n\nFirst, according to Step 1, I need to ask the user for:\n- 报销人姓名 (reimbursement person's name)\n- 出差人数 (number of people on the trip)\n- 同行人员 (fellow travelers)\n- 报销部门 (department)\n- 出差事由 (reason for travel)\n- 相关项目号 (project number)\n\nLet me ask these questions first before proceeding.","signature":"558dcf7b-f14b-4ea9-9f9d-665cbb931712"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1202,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":26240,"output_tokens":466,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"b4e1b87d-7fd0-4000-84fe-2cf242a9cc05","timestamp":"2026-07-02T06:58:32.565Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Blackmai","sessionId":"00c5369b-c3d1-477c-b00d-1a58a0ddeed5","version":"2.1.181","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"b4e1b87d-7fd0-4000-84fe-2cf242a9cc05","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"558dcf7b-f14b-4ea9-9f9d-665cbb931712","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好的，我来帮你处理出差费用报销。按照 CM.md 的流程，**第一步**需要先确认以下信息，请告诉我：\n\n1. **报销人姓名**是谁？\n2. **出差人数**（总共几个人）？\n3. **同行人员**有哪些人？（没有则填\"无\"）\n4. **报销部门**是什么？\n5. **出差事由**是什么？\n6. **相关项目号**是什么？\n\n我先列一下「发票」文件夹里已有的发票，帮你整理：\n\n| 文件 | 类型 |\n|------|------|\n| 南昌西-汕头-蔡劢.pdf | 火车票 |\n| 南昌西-汕头-陈建华.pdf | 火车票 |\n| 南昌西-汕头-付汝龙.pdf | 火车票 |\n| 南昌西-汕头-张慧仪.pdf | 火车票 |\n| 南昌西-汕头-孙伟成.pdf | 火车票 |\n| 汕头-南昌西-陈建华.pdf | 火车票 |\n| 汕头-南昌西-张慧仪.pdf | 火车票 |\n| 汕头-南昌西-孙伟成.pdf | 火车票 |\n| 住宿费发票.pdf | 住宿费 |\n| 滴滴电子发票1-张慧仪.pdf | 市内交通 |\n| 滴滴电子发票2-张慧仪.pdf | 市内交通 |\n| 滴滴电子发票1-孙伟成.pdf | 市内交通 |\n| 滴滴电子发票2-孙伟成.pdf | 市内交通 |\n\n请先回答上面的6个问题，我再继续处理！"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1202,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":26240,"output_tokens":466,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"0810aa13-5737-4f38-9d4a-0db7a2bb3d6d","timestamp":"2026-07-02T06:58:36.697Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Blackmai","sessionId":"00c5369b-c3d1-477c-b00d-1a58a0ddeed5","version":"2.1.181","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
